      "\"We have three spots open this month. If you're in that season, you already know.\"",
      "\"If you want to see what's actually holding you back, we can map it out.\"",
      "\"Link in bio. No pressure. Just see if it's the right fit.\""
    ], LIGHT_PUR, DARK),
    sp(40),

    h3("Language to Remove From All Ad Copy"),
    box([
      "Remove: 'Book a free strategy call' (sounds like every other agency)",
      "Remove: 'Limited time offer' (pressure, not safety)",
      "Remove: 'We help med spas grow' (describes Luxora, not her)",
      "Remove: 'Our program includes...' (deliverable-first, not outcome-first)",
      "Remove: 'Don't miss out' (urgency without trust is noise)"
    ], GRAY, MID),
    sp(80),

    // ══════════════════════════ CLOSING ══════════════════════════
    pb(),
    sp(100),
    div(GOLD),
    sp(60),
    new Paragraph({ alignment: AlignmentType.CENTER, spacing: { before: 40, after: 40 }, children: [new TextRun({ text: "Jacques, Here Is the One Thing to Remember", font: "Arial", size: 28, bold: true, color: PURPLE })] }),
    sp(40),
    body("The ad does not close the client. Bethany closes the client.", false, MID),
    body("The ad has one job: make her feel understood enough to take one more step.", false, MID),
    sp(40),
    body("If the hook makes a med spa owner stop and think 'how did they know that about me'... the ad is working.", true, PURPLE),
    sp(40),
    body("If the hook makes her think 'oh, this is an agency ad'... rewrite the first line.", false, MID),
    sp(60),
    div(GOLD),
    sp(40),
    new Paragraph({ alignment: AlignmentType.CENTER, spacing: { before: 20, after: 20 }, children: [new TextRun({ text: "The Luxora Collective | theluxoracollective.co", font: "Arial", size: 18, italic: true, color: PURPLE_SOFT })] }),
    new Paragraph({ alignment: AlignmentType.CENTER, spacing: { before: 0, after: 20 }, children: [new TextRun({ text: "Bethany | Co-Founder and CEO", font: "Arial", size: 17, color: MID })] }),

  ]}]
});

Packer.toBuffer(doc).then(buf => {
