    body("When content consistently makes the right person feel understood, she becomes a follower. When she becomes a follower and keeps seeing proof and story and identity content, she becomes a believer. When she becomes a believer, she eventually becomes a client. And when she becomes a client and her business transforms, she becomes the kind of person who flies to a city to be in a room with Bethany."),
    sp(40),
