    sp(40),

    ...postCard("DAY 29", "STUCK AFTER TRYING EVERYTHING | REEL + CAPTION",
      "If you're still stuck after trying everything...\n\nRead this.\n\nYou've tried ads.\nYou've tried a new hire.\nYou've tried a new software.\nMaybe a new location.\n\nAnd the needle still hasn't moved the way you expected.\n\nHere's what I've learned from working inside enough clinics to see the pattern:\n\nNone of those things work until the system underneath the business is solid.\n\nNot because those things aren't good.\nBut because they're fuel.\n\nAnd you can't pour fuel on a fire that hasn't been properly built.\n\nThe booking process has to convert.\nThe show rate has to hold.\nThe consultation has to close.\nThe retention has to run automatically.\n\nOnce those four things are built and running, everything else you add amplifies.\n\nWithout them, everything you add is just more chaos at a higher cost.\n\nThis is for the owner who is finally ready to build the foundation.\n\nLink in bio.",
      "HOOK: [direct, settled, no urgency in the voice]\n\n\"If you're still stuck after trying everything...\"\n\n[pause]\n\n\"Read this.\"\n\n\"You've tried ads. New hires. New software.\"\n\n\"The needle hasn't moved the way you expected.\"\n\n[pause]\n\n\"Here's what I know from working inside enough clinics to see the pattern:\"\n\n\"None of it works until the system underneath is solid.\"\n\n\"Not because those things aren't good.\"\n\"Because they're fuel.\"\n\n[pause]\n\n\"You can't pour fuel on a fire that hasn't been properly built.\"\n\n\"Build the foundation first.\"\n\"Then add the fuel.\"\n\"Everything amplifies.\"\n\n[direct]\n\n\"Link in bio.\"\n\n[cut]"
