    ...postCard("DAY 6", "BETHANY PERSONAL STORY | CAPTION ONLY",
      "I want to tell you something I don't say enough.\n\nI spent years inside this industry before I built Luxora.\n\nI know what it feels like to work inside a med spa and watch the same patterns repeat: the staff turnover, the inconsistent months, the leads that come in and somehow don't turn into the revenue you expected.\n\nI know what it feels like to be the person everyone relies on and still wonder in the quiet moments if the whole thing is actually stable.\n\nI built Luxora because I needed what Luxora does to exist.\n\nNot a marketing agency that runs ads.\nA real system partner who understands what happens behind the treatment room doors.\n\nThat's the difference.\nThat's why we exist.\n\nIf you've been waiting for someone who actually gets it, I think that's us.\n\nI'm Bethany. Co-founder of The Luxora Collective.\nWe help med spa owners build the system underneath the business they already love.\ntheluxoracollective.co"
